WEBVTT

00:01:28.612 --> 00:01:31.613
poštuju poniznost i mudrost,

00:01:31.613 --> 00:01:33.244
no mi oboje volimo živjeti

00:01:33.244 --> 00:01:34.581
izvan okvira stvarnosti.

00:01:34.581 --> 00:01:36.091
Vjeujem u koncept

00:01:36.091 --> 00:01:38.852
Raja Yogi: Budi frajer prije

00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:40.165
nego postaneš asket.

00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:41.660
Ovo sam ja kao rock zvijezda

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.284
čak i ako je to samo u mojoj kući.

00:01:43.284 --> 00:01:44.548
Znate?

00:01:44.548 --> 00:01:46.260
Kad smo Netra i ja sjeli

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.716
da napravimo svoj prvi plan

00:01:47.716 --> 00:01:49.700
prije 10 godina, rekli smo

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.804
da fokus ovog plana

00:01:51.804 --> 00:01:53.620
ode daleko iznad nas samih.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.284
Što mislimo kada kažemo "iznad nas samih"?

00:01:56.284 --> 00:01:59.309
Dakle, izračunali smo da je 200 godina

00:01:59.309 --> 00:02:01.484
na kraju našeg izravnog